dialog 3 Can't shell the solid.|There are no faces to take away: a shell is open where faces are taken away.\n\nShell Solid hollows the solid so far to walls of one thickness, open where faces are taken away. Select one or more of:\n\n    * faces of the solid, to take away\n\nThe solid's faces must be flat, or the solid a prism of lines and arcs open only at its ends, or one lathe or revolve of lines and arcs, and the walls must not meet.
